                    "text": {
                        "content": "## \ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Capacity, Quota & Request Shape  `[v3.3-final \u2022 Complete Edition]`\nProportional Donut distributions of context window sizes, Provisioned Throughput (PTU) utilization, and Regional Capacity Leaderboard Table.\n\n**Suite Navigation:** 00 Usage Summary | 01 Fable 5 Deep-Dive | 02 Fleet Overview | 03 Latency & SLOs | 04 Errors & Reliability | 05 Caching & FinOps | **[06 Capacity & Quota]**  \n*Features: Multi-Dimensional Interactive Filters \u2022 Ratio Scorecards \u2022 Donut Shares \u2022 Dual-Axis Correlation \u2022 Live Data Tables \u2022 SRE/FinOps Playbooks*",
                        "format": "MARKDOWN",
                        "style": {
                            "backgroundColor": "#1A2E0A",
                            "textColor": "#E0E0E0",
                            "fontSize": "FS_MEDIUM",
                            "padding": "P_MEDIUM",
