                        "content": "### Sizing Provisioned Throughput\n- **Context Bloat**: If `input_token_size` buckets shift toward `32k\u2013128k+`, TPM quota depletes rapidly even at low RPM.\n- **PTU vs Shared**: Monitor `shared_request_type` spillover during peak hours to right-size Provisioned Throughput reservations.",
